      "writtenOn": "2021-12-13T23:35:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The trouble seems to be shost_for_each_device() calls __scsi_iterate_devices() which then tries to lock the shost-\u003ehost_lock.\n\nUnfortunately, it was already taken in ufshcd_wait_for_doorbell_clr() below. So this deadlocks.",
      "revId": "198b86493c92c2c5ee55297692c6454099b00196",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
